# Append-only journals. The local bot and the cloud pre-market routine both
# add lines at the END of these files, so replaying local commits onto the
# remote's version conflicts every single time both have written -- which is
# what silently blocked auto_commit_cron.sh's push for two weeks (it aborted
# the rebase and exited before pushing). "union" keeps both sides' lines,
# which is the correct resolution for an append-only log.
#
# Deliberately NOT applied to *.json: those are single JSON objects
# (bot_state.json, control.json, the picks), and union-merging an object
# produces syntactically invalid JSON rather than a conflict you'd notice.
data/**/*.jsonl merge=union
